# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows checks text files out as CRLF, and
# `apps/desktop/src/types.ts` — which `cargo test -p eavery-core` generates
# with LF and then compares byte for byte against what is committed — is
# "stale" on Windows and nowhere else. Normalising the whole tree is the fix
# for the cause rather than for that one file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left exactly as they are.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.svg binary
